# DW Dreamweaver added files
# _notes — Dreamweaver local site notes directory (not part of the web root).
# _compareTemp — temporary comparison data created by Dreamweaver's file diff.
# configs/ — Dreamweaver site configuration directory; trailing slash means
#   only directories named "configs" are ignored, not files with that name.
_notes
_compareTemp
configs/
dwsync.xml
dw_php_codehinting.config
*.mno
